{"strongs": "H8307", "word": "שְׁרִירוּת", "translit": "she.ri.rut", "root": "שרר", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "firmness", "definition": "שְׁרִירוּת , usually שְׁרִרות noun feminine firmness , always = stubbornness ; only construct ׳ שׁ , followed by ׃לֵב : Jer 9:13 ; Jer 13:10 ; Jer 23:17 ; Deut 29:18 ; Ps 81:13 ( שְׁרִירוּת ); לִָ ם הָרָע ׳ שׁ Jer 3:17 ; Jer 7:24 ; Jer 11:8 ( ׳ שְׁרִי ), so ( לִבּוֺ ) Jer 16:12 ; Jer 18:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9054')\">BDB9054</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8307')\">H8307</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9053')\">BDB9053</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9055')\">BDB9055</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁרִירוּת</bdbheb>, usually <bdbheb>שְׁרִרות</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>firmness</highlightword>, always = <highlightword>stubbornness</highlightword>; only construct <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb>, followed by <bdbheb>׃לֵב</bdbheb> : <ref ref=\"Jer 9:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,13)\">Jer 9:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,10)\">Jer 13:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 23:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,17)\">Jer 23:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 29:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,18)\">Deut 29:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 81:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,13)\">Ps 81:13</ref> (<bdbheb>שְׁרִירוּת</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>לִָ ם הָרָע</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 3:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,17)\">Jer 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 7:24\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,24)\">Jer 7:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 11:8